    </section><section class="s_title o_cc o_colored_level o_cc4 bg-white pb120 pt64" data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_title" data-name="Title" data-mimetype="undefined">
        <div class="s_allow_columns container">
            
        <div class="row o_grid_mode" data-row-count="8"><div class="o_grid_item g-height-2 o_colored_level g-col-lg-8 col-lg-8" style="z-index: 3; grid-area: 1 / 1 / 3 / 9;"><h3 style="text-align: center;">Lavatarrat</h3><p>Kolleille saa lavatarrat "hae tarrat" painikkeella. Tarrat tulevat PDF-tiedostoina ja ne näkyvät chatterissä, josta ne voidaan avata ja tulostaa ulos.</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div><div class="o_colored_level o_grid_item g-col-lg-4 g-height-8 col-lg-4" style="z-index: 1; grid-area: 1 / 9 / 9 / 13;"><p><img src="/web/image/6907-b66f3205/screenshot-toimitus-tarra.webp" alt="" data-attachment-id="6905" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="1888" data-original-id="6905" data-original-src="/web/image/6905-ebb009be/screenshot-toimitus-tarra.jpg" data-mimetype-before-conversion="image/jpeg" data-mimetype="image/webp" loading="lazy"/></p></div><div class="o_colored_level o_grid_item g-col-lg-8 g-height-5 col-lg-8" style="z-index: 2; grid-area: 4 / 1 / 9 / 9;"><p><img src="/web/image/6906-2066860e/screenshot-toimitus-tarrat.webp" alt="" data-attachment-id="6904" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="1920" data-original-id="6904" data-original-src="/web/image/6904-440c055b/screenshot-toimitus-tarrat.jpg" data-mimetype-before-conversion="image/jpeg" data-mimetype="image/webp" loading="lazy"/></p></div></div></div>
    </section><section class="s_shape_image pt32 o_colored_level pb56 o_half_screen_height" data-snippet="s_shape_image" data-name="Shape image">
